+
+- `Module`/`FuncDef`: entry rule 1.
+- Ordered statement lists and empty branches: rules 2–3.
+- `Assign`/`Name`/`Int`: rules 4–6.
+- `BinOp("+","%","//")`: rules 7–11.
+- `Compare("<",">","==")`: rules 12–16.
+- `BoolOp("or")`: rules 17–19.
+- `If`: rules 20–22.
+- `While`: rules 23–25.
+- `Return`: rules 26–27.
+
